  "spacing": {
    "topBarToHeader": 16,
    "headerToTabs": 20,
    "tabsToCalendarCard": 18,
    "calendarCardToMonthStats": 16,
    "monthStatsToSelectedDayCard": 16,
    "selectedDayCardToBottomNav": 18
  },
  "aiDesignerPrompt": "Create a mobile iOS screen in Russian for PillPath, a family child-health app. Screen type: Child Overview > Calendar. Make it warm, soft, human, and intuitive. Use a creamy pastel background (#FFF8F5), white cards, subtle peach borders, dark navy typography, and coral accents. Layout: back link '← К профилю ребёнка', large title 'Обзор · Эдик', subtitle 'Выберите день и сразу посмотрите, что происходило с ребёнком.', two circular action buttons on the top right, segmented tabs with 'Календарь' active, a large month calendar card with legend and color dots, monthly quick stats, then a selected day record list with add button, and a floating bottom navigation. The calendar must be the main focus. It should feel simple, friendly, readable, and calm, like a care dashboard for parents."
